               "summary":  "ON fell 7.43% to $60.84 on 2026-11-20 during the AI chip rout. It closed below every EMA and its lower Bollinger Band, with MACD negative and RSI at 34.31: a bearish but stretched chart. The business did well in Q3, and AI data center revenue is growing fast. However, the 6 Nov cancellation of the Czech SiC expansion, along with flat auto sales, weakens the \u0027SiC scale\u0027 moat as onsemi pivots to AI power and two acquisitions. The thesis is worth watching closely."
